        <item>
            <title>1.0.30</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Right-clicking a sender or recipient name now opens the same address card as a left-click, with Copy Address and New Email.</li>
<li>Fixed recipient names turning black and unreadable in dark mode when typing the next address after adding one.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
