        <item>
            <title>1.0.29</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Faster search.</strong> Searching now loads only what the results list needs instead of downloading every matching conversation in full, so results appear much sooner.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Notes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Search results no longer show the attachment name under a conversation until you open it. Attachments themselves are unchanged.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
